@*
    Task 15.2 — the ASP.NET Core replacement for this plugin's web.config
    <system.web.webPages.razor><pages> element (Requirement 4.4).

    THIS FILE IS PART OF THE PLUGIN RECIPE. See
    src/Plugins/Nop.Plugin.DiscountRules.CustomerRoles/Views/_ViewImports.cshtml for the full
    reasoning. @inherits WebViewPage<TModel> is what makes T("…") resolve and the @model bind;
    the @using directives are the four System.Web <namespaces> translated (System.Web.Mvc.Ajax
    dropped, no counterpart).

    Configure.cshtml declares `@model … .ConfigurationModel` fully qualified, so the
    @using Nop.Plugin.Widgets.GoogleAnalytics.Models below is not strictly required — present for
    consistency.

    NOTE Configure.cshtml calls JavaScriptHelper.Encode (the task-15.2 replacement for 3.90's
    HttpUtility.JavaScriptStringEncode); JavaScriptHelper lives in Nop.Web.Framework, which
    @using Nop.Web.Framework below covers.
*@
@inherits Nop.Web.Framework.ViewEngines.Razor.WebViewPage<TModel>

@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Html
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.Rendering
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Routing

@using Nop.Core.Infrastructure
@using Nop.Web.Framework
@using Nop.Web.Framework.UI
@using Nop.Plugin.Widgets.GoogleAnalytics.Models

@addTagHelper *, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.TagHelpers
